{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34375","headline":"徐方平後闻赦因寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"徐方平後闻赦因寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新春旒扆御翬轩，海内初传涣汗恩。\n秦狱已收爲厉气，瘴江初返未招魂。\n英材尽作龙蛇蛰，战地多成虎豹村。\n除却数般伤痛外，不知何事及王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}